{"4417840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Book of Prosperity", "steam_appid": 4417840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In a world where memories disappear, every secret has a price.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Book of Prosperity is a 2D action RPG about memory, power, and the price of a seemingly prosperous world. Step into a surreal pixel-art realm where neon-lit cityscapes collide with ancient magic, and where a peaceful surface hides something far more dangerous beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Cyrus, a sharp-tongued student dragged into a parallel dimension shaped by The Circle, a powerful organization that claims to protect people from painful memories. But in a world where forgetting is treated as safety, every missing memory becomes a clue, and every risky choice brings Cyrus closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a timing-focused combat system built around parries, dodges, skill combos, and resource management. Leap across rooftops, caves, and fractured city spaces with fluid parkour movement. Build alliances with a vivid cast of characters, each carrying their own secrets, loyalties, and scars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/3b53ba7e1dfc99b8f05cfc88388b7fd2.avif?t=1784287397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras_big/3b53ba7e1dfc99b8f05cfc88388b7fd2.webp?t=1784287397 width=1560 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rhythmic Action Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/bfdc924b4ac399330e8bdd54f9d08941.poster.avif?t=1784287397\" width=1002 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/bfdc924b4ac399330e8bdd54f9d08941.webm?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/bfdc924b4ac399330e8bdd54f9d08941.mp4?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with precision in a timing-sensitive battle system that rewards well-timed parries, dodges, and counterattacks. Chain skills together, manage mana under pressure, and stay in motion to keep control of the fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast, Fluid Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/a4b8e57e0f0605e238444abcec464b45.poster.avif?t=1784287397\" width=1002 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/a4b8e57e0f0605e238444abcec464b45.webm?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/a4b8e57e0f0605e238444abcec464b45.mp4?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse rooftops, caves, and layered city environments with kinetic parkour. Jump, recover, and move through the world with speed as Cyrus stays one step ahead of The Circle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Hong Kong-Inspired Magical World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/b808882ddff53c885fc5d01b0a47054e.poster.avif?t=1784287397\" width=1002 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/b808882ddff53c885fc5d01b0a47054e.webm?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/b808882ddff53c885fc5d01b0a47054e.mp4?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a distinctive setting where modern urban architecture, Eastern aesthetics, and surreal fantasy collide. Move between familiar city spaces and a hidden magical realm shaped by lost memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Character-Driven Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/b5b665f2b77458f3074f69a3dbea267b.poster.avif?t=1784287397\" width=1002 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/b5b665f2b77458f3074f69a3dbea267b.webm?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/b5b665f2b77458f3074f69a3dbea267b.mp4?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a diverse cast of allies and rivals, from the sarcastic Cyrus to the brooding Tonitrus. Uncover their motives, question their loyalties, and navigate the moral grey areas of a story-rich isekai adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secrets Beneath Prosperity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/3b53ba7e1dfc99b8f05cfc88388b7fd2.avif?t=1784287397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras_big/3b53ba7e1dfc99b8f05cfc88388b7fd2.webp?t=1784287397 width=1560 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Circle claims forgetting can bring peace. As Cyrus digs deeper, he discovers that the world's prosperity may be built on hidden costs, sacrifice, and memories someone desperately wants buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/3b53ba7e1dfc99b8f05cfc88388b7fd2.avif?t=1784287397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras_big/3b53ba7e1dfc99b8f05cfc88388b7fd2.webp?t=1784287397 width=1560 height=250 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In a world where memories disappear, every secret has a price.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Book of Prosperity is a 2D action RPG about memory, power, and the price of a seemingly prosperous world. Step into a surreal pixel-art realm where neon-lit cityscapes collide with ancient magic, and where a peaceful surface hides something far more dangerous beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Cyrus, a sharp-tongued student dragged into a parallel dimension shaped by The Circle, a powerful organization that claims to protect people from painful memories. But in a world where forgetting is treated as safety, every missing memory becomes a clue, and every risky choice brings Cyrus closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a timing-focused combat system built around parries, dodges, skill combos, and resource management. Leap across rooftops, caves, and fractured city spaces with fluid parkour movement. Build alliances with a vivid cast of characters, each carrying their own secrets, loyalties, and scars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/3b53ba7e1dfc99b8f05cfc88388b7fd2.avif?t=1784287397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras_big/3b53ba7e1dfc99b8f05cfc88388b7fd2.webp?t=1784287397 width=1560 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rhythmic Action Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/bfdc924b4ac399330e8bdd54f9d08941.poster.avif?t=1784287397\" width=1002 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/bfdc924b4ac399330e8bdd54f9d08941.webm?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/bfdc924b4ac399330e8bdd54f9d08941.mp4?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with precision in a timing-sensitive battle system that rewards well-timed parries, dodges, and counterattacks. Chain skills together, manage mana under pressure, and stay in motion to keep control of the fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast, Fluid Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/a4b8e57e0f0605e238444abcec464b45.poster.avif?t=1784287397\" width=1002 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/a4b8e57e0f0605e238444abcec464b45.webm?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/a4b8e57e0f0605e238444abcec464b45.mp4?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse rooftops, caves, and layered city environments with kinetic parkour. Jump, recover, and move through the world with speed as Cyrus stays one step ahead of The Circle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Hong Kong-Inspired Magical World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/b808882ddff53c885fc5d01b0a47054e.poster.avif?t=1784287397\" width=1002 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/b808882ddff53c885fc5d01b0a47054e.webm?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/b808882ddff53c885fc5d01b0a47054e.mp4?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a distinctive setting where modern urban architecture, Eastern aesthetics, and surreal fantasy collide. Move between familiar city spaces and a hidden magical realm shaped by lost memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Character-Driven Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/b5b665f2b77458f3074f69a3dbea267b.poster.avif?t=1784287397\" width=1002 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/b5b665f2b77458f3074f69a3dbea267b.webm?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/b5b665f2b77458f3074f69a3dbea267b.mp4?t=1784287397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a diverse cast of allies and rivals, from the sarcastic Cyrus to the brooding Tonitrus. Uncover their motives, question their loyalties, and navigate the moral grey areas of a story-rich isekai adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secrets Beneath Prosperity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/3b53ba7e1dfc99b8f05cfc88388b7fd2.avif?t=1784287397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras_big/3b53ba7e1dfc99b8f05cfc88388b7fd2.webp?t=1784287397 width=1560 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Circle claims forgetting can bring peace. As Cyrus digs deeper, he discovers that the world's prosperity may be built on hidden costs, sacrifice, and memories someone desperately wants buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras/3b53ba7e1dfc99b8f05cfc88388b7fd2.avif?t=1784287397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/extras_big/3b53ba7e1dfc99b8f05cfc88388b7fd2.webp?t=1784287397 width=1560 height=250 /></span></p>", "short_description": "The Book of Prosperity is a 2D action RPG in a surreal pixel-art Hong Kong where ancient magic seeps through modern streets and skyscrapers. Student Cyrus must master rhythmic combat, rooftop parkour, and buried secrets to uncover prosperity's hidden cost.", "supported_languages": "English, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean, Polish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/8b9d6835dff5687694ba49c015cd4f5214853dde/header.jpg?t=1784287397", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4417840/1cfb255ab00292e5ec6e1dd4085b6ff27f9ec374/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784287397", "capsule_imagev